# ============================================================
# What NOT to publish
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# This repository IS the public website — everything committed
# here gets served at a guessable URL. Anything listed below
# stays on your machine and never reaches the web.
#
# These files still exist in your local site/assets/ folder.
# If you ever link one from a page, REMOVE ITS LINE HERE FIRST,
# or the page will ship with a broken image/download.
# ============================================================

# --- Unannounced subscriber surprise -------------------------
# The build spec is explicit that the Binder wallpapers must not
# be listed, mentioned, teased or linked anywhere. Publishing
# them would make them findable by URL and spoil the reveal.
assets/Binder/

# --- Large unreferenced files --------------------------------
# The media kit page offers press assets "by email on request",
# so this 29 MB PDF is not linked from anywhere on the site.
assets/downloads/media-kit.pdf
assets/downloads/book-club-one-sheet.pdf

# --- Superseded source art -----------------------------------
# The lead-magnet covers are served as optimised .webp versions
# (assets/doc-*.webp); these are the original PNGs.
assets/lead magnet images/

# Rejected / replaced artwork, kept locally for reference only.
assets/illustrative NACT.jpg
assets/emblem-moon-1024.png
assets/cat-book.png
assets/logo-black.png
assets/jmccarthy-logo.svg

# --- OS / editor cruft ---------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
.vscode/
.idea/

# --- Never commit ---------------------------------------------
node_modules/
.env
.env.*
